<title>SWITZERLAND: Saurer H1 surges 243 pct to 48 mln Sfr.</title>
<headline>Saurer H1 surges 243 pct to 48 mln Sfr.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss industrial group Saurer AG said group net profit surged to 48 million Swiss francs in the first half of 1997 from 14 million, a result that was better than the company had expected.</p>
<p>Saurer also said in a first-half statement that it expects this &quot;positive trend will continue for the remainder of the year&quot;.</p>
</text>
